Timelord Mac links dg_xch_utils crates from GalactechsLLC, compatibility fork revision
3b50863ee641c67e4c46b9a18640001e0c94833f, under the Apache License 2.0.
https://github.com/cameroncooper/dg_xch_utils

The regular scheduler, protocol/consensus types, authenticated transport helpers
and VDF verification are used as dependencies. The native-client adapter and
application lifecycle are maintained in this repository. The fork modifies
upstream protocol codecs, consensus hashing and the timelord scheduler. No upstream
source files are vendored in the app repository. See LICENSE and Cargo.lock for
provenance.

ICC seed translation follows Scheduler.set_peak/finish at the pinned revision.

PoS2 witness verification uses Chia Network chia-pos2 1.0.0 (Apache-2.0),
https://github.com/Chia-Network/pos2.
